---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import ProjectGallery from '../components/ProjectGallery.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Sydney Scaffolding Company Since 1996 | Secure Scaffolding"
  description="Australian-owned Sydney scaffolding company providing scaffold hire, installation, transport and engineered access solutions since 1996."
  current="about"
  image="/projects/prime-bluescope-erskine-park/IMG_6327.webp"
>
  <main>
    <PageHeader
      eyebrow="Our story"
      title="A Sydney scaffolding company built on experience."
      intro="Australian-owned and based in Mount Kuring-Gai, Secure Scaffolding has delivered dependable access solutions since 1996."
    />

    <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
      <div class="wrap about-story">
        <div>
          <p class="lead">The Secure Scaffolding business was founded in 1996 as a labour hire company with just two crews of scaffolders. By early 1997, we were entrusted with the Wood Chopping Arena and Horticultural Building at the New Sydney Showgrounds for Hansen Yuncken. We also partnered with AW Edwards for scaffold and rigging works, rapidly growing our workforce to 24 skilled professionals.</p>
          <p class="lead">By 2000, we had completed all unit blocks in the Olympic Village for Mirvac Constructions and many other significant projects for major builders. Our team expanded to 40 scaffolders, including eight contracted to the French company Nussli to build the Volleyball Stadium at Bondi Beach for the Sydney Olympics. After this, Nussli offered us opportunities for international work.</p>
          <p class="lead">Post-Olympics, Secure Scaffolding continued its upward trajectory, securing contracts with major companies such as Boral, PCH, Mirvac and Multiplex. We also commenced the retrofit of the athletes’ village with Newington Homes.</p>
          <p class="lead">In 2001, we won the first stage of post-Olympic housing, delivering 45 homes. From that point forward, we secured every housing contract for the project, which was completed in November 2008, with a contract value exceeding $10 million.</p>
          <p class="lead">That same year, we expanded into scaffolding hire and transportation services with the launch of Secure Domestic Safety Access Pty Ltd.</p>
          <p class="lead">In 2024, we rebranded as Secure Scaffolding Services Pty Ltd, continuing our dedication to excellence while steadily enhancing our services. Since the rebrand, we have continued expanding the business, welcoming more team members and working with more builders and construction partners across Greater Sydney, the Central Coast and Newcastle.</p>
          <p class="lead">Today, we bring together experienced people, dependable equipment and practical site coordination to support <a href="/services/commercial-scaffolding-sydney/">commercial scaffolding</a>, <a href="/services/bridge-access-scaffolding-sydney/">bridge and infrastructure access</a>, residential construction, industrial facilities, health projects and <a href="/services/public-access-stairs-sydney/">public pedestrian access</a>.</p>
          <p class="lead">We remain committed to the reliability that has defined the Secure Scaffolding name for decades while building the team, equipment and builder relationships for our next stage of growth.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="list">
          <div class="list-row">1996 <span>Secure Scaffolding founded</span></div>
          <div class="list-row">1997 <span>New Sydney Showgrounds and AW Edwards</span></div>
          <div class="list-row">2000 <span>Sydney Olympics projects</span></div>
          <div class="list-row">2008 <span>Post-Olympic housing program completed</span></div>
          <div class="list-row">2024 <span>Rebranded as Secure Scaffolding Services Pty Ltd</span></div>
          <div class="list-row">Today <span>Sydney, Central Coast and Newcastle coverage</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section about-contact">
      <div class="wrap split">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</div>
          <h2>Talk to Secure Scaffolding.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="about-contact-details">
          <p><strong>Visit</strong><br />5 Gundah Road, Mount Kuring-Gai NSW 2080</p>
          <p><strong>Call</strong><br /><a href="tel:+61294570133">02 9457 0133</a><br /><a href="tel:+6141259864">0412 598 864</a></p>
          <p><strong>Email</strong><br /><a href="mailto:info@securescaffolding.com.au">info@securescaffolding.com.au</a></p>
          <p><a href="/service-areas/">View our scaffolding service areas ↗</a></p>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Request a quote ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section band">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow" style="color:#d7f54b">Project record</div>
            <h2>Work that tells the story.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="lead">From bridges and hospitals to commercial and residential sites, our experience spans the environments where safe access matters most.</p>
        </div>
        <ProjectGallery />
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-story a{font-weight:800;color:#607300;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:3px}
</style>
